----------------------

An auxiliary grob to (vertically) align stacked *note Script:: grobs.

   ‘ScriptColumn’ objects are created by the following engraver(s):
*note Non_musical_script_column_engraver:: and *note
Script_column_engraver::.

   Standard settings:

     ‘before-line-breaking’ (boolean):
          ‘ly:script-column::before-line-breaking’

          Dummy property, used to trigger a callback function.

   This object supports the following interface(s): *note
grob-interface::, *note item-interface:: and *note
script-column-interface::.

   This object is of class Item (characterized by *note
item-interface::).


