   ‘ScriptRow’ objects are created by the following engraver(s): *note
Script_row_engraver::.

   Standard settings:

     ‘before-line-breaking’ (boolean):
          ‘ly:script-column::row-before-line-breaking’

          Dummy property, used to trigger a callback function.

